# 13. Consultant Background and Credentials

Klaud’s services are delivered by senior consultants with more than **16 years of hands-on experience** designing, implementing, operating, upgrading, and troubleshooting VMware-based platforms.

Our consulting team has worked across enterprise virtualization, private cloud, software-defined networking, software-defined storage, cloud automation, Kubernetes enablement, load balancing, security, and operational management. This experience allows Klaud to support partners not only with product implementation, but also with architecture decisions, delivery strategy, risk management, and operational readiness.

Klaud’s value comes from combining deep technical specialization with real-world implementation experience across complex VMware environments.

