## 13.1 VMware and Private Cloud Experience

Klaud’s consultants have extensive experience across the VMware ecosystem, including:

* VMware Cloud Foundation architecture and implementation
* vSphere architecture, operations, and lifecycle management
* vSAN design, deployment, troubleshooting, and optimization
* NSX networking, routing, security, and multi-site design
* VCF Automation and private cloud self-service models
* VMware vSphere Kubernetes Service enablement
* VCF Operations, monitoring, capacity, and operational visibility
* Avi Load Balancer / NSX ALB architecture and implementation
* vDefend security and microsegmentation use cases
* Upgrade, migration, and re-platforming projects
* Environment stabilization and project rescue scenarios
* Hybrid cloud and private cloud modernization initiatives

This background allows Klaud to support partners across the full lifecycle of a VMware Cloud Foundation initiative, from early-stage opportunity validation to architecture, deployment, knowledge transfer, and post-deployment stabilization.

